File.WriteAllText(Path.Combine(output,"README.md"),"""
# AETHERIS-BUNNY-M3 evidence

M3 separates structural `PanelIr` support from sampled scalar offset and differential-only normal fields, replaces the SurfaceMeshIR plane proxy with a native bounded parametric evaluator, and replaces M2's local matching with deterministic Edmonds blossom matching.

